  "description": "LOVE THE JOURNEY Gliding from A to B has never been this fun. The LYFE e-Bike energises you to get on and go, to tackle cross city trips and beyond with confidence, speed and joy. LYFE keeps it breezy with a relaxed riding position and ergonomically designed contact points. Hop on and enjoy a comfortable ride that allows you to take in the world as you navigate the streets and trails amid the ebb and flow of daily life. At just 17kg (size large Equipped), LYFE is the apartment dwellers friend, as it is easy to lift and easy to live with. Electric assistance is delivered by the rear hub drive Ebikemotion X35 system, manufactured by German automotive manufacturer MAHLE. The 36V 250W motor provides ample assistance for you to keep pace with traffic and cruise uphill, ensuring you reach your destination fast, with a smile upon your face. LYFE has up to 75km range between charges so you can ride on in confidence as you power to your destination. When the mood strikes to work a little harder, the integrated iWoc controller allows you to select from three assistance levels on the fly, so you can choose when to sweat and when to glide. LYFE EQUIPPED Equipped models come fully loaded with extra equipment for effortless riding. Mudguards, kickstand, rack and integrated lights complete the package. Availability: If you can add a bike to your basket, it is available to pre-order directly from us for delivery shortly after the bikes arrive in our warehouse (currently early July). Otherwise that size/configuration is fully presold to Kinesis dealers. To find a Kinesis dealer that has pre-ordered the LYFE bikes, please consult this map. Please note we can't guarantee whether dealers have any stock left to buy, or which specific sizes/configurations they have ordered, but it should act as a good starting point to finding a LYFE ebike.",
